cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Novachrono in your work, please cite it using the following
  metadata.
title: Novachrono
type: software
version: 0.1.0

authors:
  - family-names: Steinberg
    given-names: Henning

url: https://github.com/drachenpapa/novachrono
repository-code: https://github.com/drachenpapa/novachrono

license: MIT

abstract: >-
  Novachrono is a self-hosted dashboard renderer for the Divoom Times Gate.
  It generates a consistent five-screen interface for current weather, local
  time and date, Pokémon GO raid bosses, and selected Pokémon GO events.
  It supports local previews as well as static and animated delivery through
  the Times Gate local network API.

keywords:
  - Divoom
  - Times Gate
  - dashboard
  - Python
  - Raspberry Pi
  - pixel display
  - Pokémon GO
